# Cloudflare Workers static assets (wrangler.jsonc). Everything else keeps
# Cloudflare's default, revalidate on every load; a header set by two
# matching rules would be joined with a comma, so Cache-Control is set once.
#
# The policy has one directive and restricts only audio and video
# (spec/guides.md §10.3): this site, the blob: URLs narration plays from,
# and the guide-video host, MEDIA_ORIGIN in src/guides/media-origin.ts,
# which a test holds to this line. Everything else is as open as before.
# GitHub Pages ignores this file.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: media-src 'self' blob: https://media.transparent.sbdev.io

# Vite fingerprints everything under assets/, so it never changes in place.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
